</ul>

<h4 class="text-lg font-medium text-white/80 mb-2 mt-4">2.2.5 靶材</h4>

<p class="text-white/70 my-3 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-white/90">作用</strong>：物理气相沉积（PVD）的靶材，HBM多层阻挡层、金属层沉积刚需。</p>
<ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 my-3 text-white/70">
<li>HBM消耗量为普通DRAM的3-5倍</li>
<li>钨靶、钼靶、钛靶、铜靶需求量大</li>
</ul>

<p class="text-white/70 my-3 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-white/90">相关标的</strong>：</p>
<ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 my-3 text-white/70">
