<h4 class="text-lg font-medium text-white/80 mb-2 mt-4">2.2.6 光刻胶</h4>

<p class="text-white/70 my-3 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-white/90">作用</strong>：HBM TSV（硅通孔）工艺的光刻胶。</p>
<ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 my-3 text-white/70">
<li>深硅刻蚀需要厚膜光刻胶</li>
