<h4 class="text-lg font-medium text-white/80 mb-2 mt-4">2.3.2 先进封装（CoWoS）</h4>

<p class="text-white/70 my-3 leading-relaxed">HBM需要通过CoWoS（Chip-on-Wafer-on-Substrate）等2.5D/3D封装技术与GPU/ASIC集成。</p>

<p class="text-white/70 my-3 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-white/90">产能瓶颈</strong>：</p>
<ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 my-3 text-white/70">
<li>台积电CoWoS产能是AI芯片的核心瓶颈之一</li>
<li>2026年台积电CoWoS产能继续扩张，但仍供不应求</li>
<li>国内封测厂加速追赶，但高端产能仍有限</li>
</ul>

<p class="text-white/70 my-3 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-white/90">相关标的</strong>：</p>
<ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 my-3 text-white/70">
